Troubleshooting Tips
Issue: Script shows "File not found"

Ensure you're in the correct directory: pwd
Verify the log file exists: ls -l auth.log
Issue: No alerts detected

Check your threshold value (lower it to 3 or 4)
Verify log file format matches expected pattern
Add debug print statements to see parsed entries
Issue: Parsing errors

Ensure log file has correct format with spaces between fields
Check for extra whitespace or special characters
Issue: Permission denied

Make script executable: chmod +x detector.py
Check file permissions: ls -l detector.py
